      "created_at": "2014-11-17T03:51:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just had a wacky edge case happen in the app.&nbsp; I'm 90% sure it's legit, but I wanted to confirm -- and tell the story! :-)</p><p>Fanatic is Undaunted.&nbsp; Lava Flow happens, and starts out by doing 4 points of damage.&nbsp; But Obsidian Field is in play, upping it to 5 points.&nbsp; Undaunted lowers the 5 to 3.&nbsp; But then Wraith's two Mega Computers kick in, each reducing the damage by a further 1, down to a new total of 1.&nbsp; And finally, Undaunted kicks in with its *other* sentence, and prevents the damage entirely!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:53.494Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
