    {
      "id": 120754,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-17T14:37:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I ran into a similar situation with cards vs. Amby, Wraith had stun bolted him, and had smoke bombs out.</p><p>Amby goes to hit for 5 damage (boosted somehow), it gets Smoke Bombed to Fanatic, who has undaunted.</p><p>I ended up ruling that Smoke Bombs applied reduction immediately on redirection, so that Undaunted could not reduce the damage.</p><p>I'm wondering if that was correct now.</p><p>To test this I think an EPE would be required. &nbsp;Any easier way to trigger smoke bombs and send 5 damage to Fanatic?</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:54:15.428Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11555,
      "topic_slug": "double-undaunted",
      "display_username": "phantaskippy",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
