      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I ran into a similar situation with cards vs. Amby, Wraith had stun bolted him, and had smoke bombs out.</p><p>Amby goes to hit for 5 damage (boosted somehow), it gets Smoke Bombed to Fanatic, who has undaunted.</p><p>I ended up ruling that Smoke Bombs applied reduction immediately on redirection, so that Undaunted could not reduce the damage.</p><p>I&#39;m wondering if that was correct now.</p><p>To test this I think an EPE would be required. &nbsp;Any easier way to trigger smoke bombs and send 5 damage to Fanatic?</p>",
