      "created_at": "2014-11-17T16:26:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"xThe Killswitch\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n xThe Killswitch:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Has it been ruled that the order of damage modification is entirely up to the players?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, it was later ruled that way. Cards are applied in order played during Start/End phases, but otherwise in order specified by players.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
